    "content_md": "Sauna bathing is about **calming down**. This guide covers how to sauna properly. This is fake test data.\n\n## First round\n\nSit calmly and throw a little water at a time. See [sauna sessions](/en/sauna/).\n\n![img](img:7)\n\n## Rest and hydration\n\n- Drink water after sauna\n- Rest until your pulse settles\n\n:::cta\n**Book your own sauna moment**\nSipoonjoki Heritage Sauna offers a smoke sauna and treatments. Choose a time and book online.\n[Book now](/en/book/)\n:::",
